# Skill: Linarex Quality Gate

## Purpose

This skill ensures the Linarex Next.js project maintains functionality after changes. It runs TypeScript checks, lint, and end-to-end tests to verify the EPK (Electronic Press Kit) functionality works correctly.

## When to Use

- Before completing any code change in the Linarex project
- After implementing new features (EPK, BookerInfo, contact flows, etc.)
- Before deployment to verify everything works

## Commands

### 1. TypeScript Check

```bash
cd /Users/mikemac/Mike-docs/DEV-EDUCATION/app/react/linarex/linarex/linarex && npx tsc --noEmit
```

- Pass criteria: command exits 0 with no type errors
- Location: `src/components/`, `src/lib/`, `src/app/`

### 2. Lint Check

```bash
cd /Users/mikemac/Mike-docs/DEV-EDUCATION/app/react/linarex/linarex/linarex && npm run lint
```

- Pass criteria: no blocking errors
- Project script: `eslint` (Next.js 15 / ESLint config in repo)

### 3. Build Check

```bash
cd /Users/mikemac/Mike-docs/DEV-EDUCATION/app/react/linarex/linarex/linarex && npm run build
```

- Pass criteria: compiles successfully without errors
- This validates all TSX/TS files, metadata, and routing

### 4. E2E Tests (Playwright)

```bash
cd /Users/mikemac/Mike-docs/DEV-EDUCATION/app/react/linarex/linarex/linarex && npx playwright test
```

- Runs all tests in `tests/e2e/`
- Reports: HTML report opened with `npx playwright show-report`
- Tests verify:
  - EPK page loads without errors
  - Homepage renders correctly
  - No "New dates coming soon" text (since no dates exist)
  - Contact email links are present and enabled
  - Live show repertoire description includes original songs and covers

### 5. Local Development Start

```bash
cd /Users/mikemac/Mike-docs/DEV-EDUCATION/app/react/linarex/linarex/linarex && npm run dev
```

- Starts dev server at <http://localhost:3000>
- Manual verification: navigate to /epk, /, and check all sections

## Verification Checklist (Post-Change)

### EPK Functionality

- [ ] EPK page (`/epk`) loads without 500 errors
- [ ] Hero section displays artist name, role, and pitch
- [ ] "Original music" pitch text is present
- [ ] About section shows artist roots/style (Dominican Republic, musical genres)
- [ ] Repertoire description mentions "Original songs plus selected covers"
- [ ] Live show section shows "Linarex Experience" with Jacke Matheus
- [ ] "Connect & Stream" section is visible with Spotify/YouTube/Instagram links
- [ ] No `#contact` anchor link in hero actions (contact is inline)
- [ ] BookerInfo does not show "New dates coming soon"

### Contact Flow

- [ ] Email `mailto:linarexinfo@gmail.com` link is present in EPK
- [ ] No anchor `#contact` redirects away from EPK page
- [ ] WhatsApp link (if configured) works

### Technical Compliance

- [ ] TypeScript: no type errors (`npx tsc --noEmit`)
- [ ] Lint: no blocking errors (`npm run lint`)
- [ ] Build: compiles successfully (`npm run build`)
- [ ] E2E: all Playwright tests pass (`npx playwright test`)

## Example Workflow

```bash
# 1. Make changes to components
# 2. Check TypeScript
npx tsc --noEmit
# 3. Run lint
npm run lint
# 4. Build
npm run build
# 5. Run E2E tests
npx playwright test
# 6. If all pass, deploy
```

## Notes

- The project uses Next.js 15 with app router (`/app/(en)/epk/page.tsx`)
- EPK is rendered at `/epk` and `/pl/epk` locales
- BookerInfo section shows "For bookers" info but dates are omitted when no shows exist
- Connect & Stream section was added per user feedback requirements
